>Morris</surname><given-names>M.E.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Additional sequence complexity in the muscle gene, <italic>unc-22</italic>, and its encoded protein twitchin, of <italic>Caenorhabditis elegans</italic></article-title><source>Genetics.</source><volume>134</volume><year>1993</year><fpage>1097</fpage><lpage>1104</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8397135</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R8"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Blumenthal</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Steward</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>RNA processing and gene structure</article-title><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Riddle</surname><given-names>D.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Blumenthal</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Meyer</surname><given-names>B.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Priess</surname><given-names>J.R.</given-names></name></person-group><source>C. elegans II</source><year>1997</year><fpage>117</fpage><lpage>145</lpage><publisher-name>Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory Press</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Cold Spring Harbor, NY</publisher-loc></citation></ref><ref id="R9"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bodenteich</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Chissoe</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>Y.F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Roe</surname><given-names>B.A.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Shotgun cloning as the strategy of choice to generate templates for high-throughput dideoxy sequencing</article-title><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Venter</surname><given-names>J.C.</given-names></name></person-group><source>Automated DNA Sequencing and Analysis Techniques</source><year>1993</year><fpage>42</fpage>