rin is required for hemidesmosome formation, cell adhesion and cell survival</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>134</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>559</fpage><lpage>572</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8707838</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eddy</surname><given-names>S.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Mitchison</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Durbin</surname><given-names>R.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mosimum discrimination hidden Markov models of sequence consensus</article-title><source>J. Comput. Biol.</source><volume>2</volume><year>1995</year><fpage>9</fpage><lpage>23</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7497123</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eddy</surname><given-names>S.R.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hidden Markov models</article-title><source>Cold Spring Harbor Symp. Quant. Biol</source><volume>6</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>361</fpage><lpage>365</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="R19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ey</surname><given-names>P.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ashman</surname><given-names>L.K.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The use of alkaline phosphatase-conjugated anti-immunoglobulin with immunoblots for determining the specificity of monoclonal antibodies to protein mixtures</article-title><source>Methods Enzymol</source><volume>121</volume><year>1986</year><fpage>497</fpage><lpage>509</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3523128</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fire</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><sur